msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7828B9FF_F8E6_4F8F_A06F_0E3CB4F58FF5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He would merely nod as he accepted it, his face contorted in discomfort, and then pore over "
"the text when he was alone."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele apenas acenava com a cabeça ao aceitar, seu rosto contorcido de desconforto, e então se "
"debruçava sobre o texto quando estava sozinho."

#: scenario3:scenario3_19CFD068_422C_4A7F_9260_1CE39BFEEB4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d23dab53b0471cde2af332de552f61b436b25ae41263aae7693a23ba50553ca6
