msgid "⟪k:0⟫I assume he did not want her to see his heart sinking into darkness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Suponho que ele não queria que ela visse seu coração afundando na escuridão."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D1D1587E_189A_45F6_8DFE_8BD627FBD823
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33c88a78fc868cc12ba7a625af4699d5c3dd209f4682159da7ec71d9faad7f73
