msgid "⟪k:0⟫Had he put his trust in his wife rather than Maria..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se ele tivesse confiado em sua esposa em vez de em Maria..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_86406C83_4B36_4C3F_8CC6_F48CAD8E8C13
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 951e1769cc9ef125fae561bf134bcf8f76a07f3ca4e6058412eeb00cc3380995
