msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_35F58E7B_DAE2_401E_B9CA_4E67094F114F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Would you maintain faith in her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the woman who had waited so long?⟪k:3⟫Would you "
"believe the feelings she professed for you were genuine?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você manteria a fé nela—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a mulher que esperou tanto? Você acreditaria que os "
"sentimentos que ela professava por você eram genuínos?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B258CCD9_53ED_4E32_B7B4_41798DF92CF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b572c7321e6989b9f4593a1bedda651b9391a7570620ca851eb98daeb22dcdc
#. default-sha256: d6f1730ad1cb51f477e302b84b13fb00f5c0e9f829e8689f00b51dc94e9be2da
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B258CCD9_53ED_4E32_B7B4_41798DF92CF2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She continued writing letters—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫day after day, week after week—"
"⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫without hiatus. ⟪k:9⟫She had, by and large, run out of things to say, but that did not "
"put an end to her letter-writing; she simply repeated what she had written before."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ela continuou escrevendo cartas—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫dia após dia, semana após "
"semana—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫sem hiato. ⟪k:9⟫Ela tinha, em geral, ficado sem coisas para dizer, mas isso não "
"pôs fim à sua escrita de cartas; ela simplesmente repetiu o que havia escrito antes."

#: scenario3:scenario3_78EE2711_CC0B_4F2D_B567_91BEEAE53482
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a214b4983402efb3f934224a4251f6547f9b1024d221ee377ad4a8bb5ff8255
#. default-sha256: 67f398311a297000a7659cd7c897e05a246098046294268f69c731c9c14309f7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_78EE2711_CC0B_4F2D_B567_91BEEAE53482"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, they did not see one another in person.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The White-Haired Girl, "
"forbidden from leaving her shed,⟪k:3⟫could only wait for her husband to pay her a visit."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No entanto, eles não se viam pessoalmente.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A Garota de Cabelos Brancos, proibida de "
"sair de seu barracão,⟪k:3⟫só podia esperar que o marido a visitasse."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8408EBA5_2745_4E66_9797_E6E12DEE1579
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82ca0b76b810d50f853e7e65f5f0aa355c4170eeb648b05bd53c93b429ea5553
#. default-sha256: e549c982e1f30ff25370ae334cce0245b739e811a08fc8366aaa69eae01d0a1a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8408EBA5_2745_4E66_9797_E6E12DEE1579"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My beloved,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There is a little bit of fog out today.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Weather like this "
"reminds me of my home country.⟪k:6⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Meu amado, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Há um pouco de neblina hoje. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Um clima assim me lembra "
"meu país natal.⟪k:6⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_EE588D42_1756_4033_BA03_96194D2307FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43f22a35ef85d0d151f5b3d8efe9971a9a13e028b19ff5c315f67ef97d6f0a04
#. default-sha256: 6c2071da9fcc37801196679faa1ee9782928784b03d3333f757812623c26ddb3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE588D42_1756_4033_BA03_96194D2307FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was born on an island perpetually covered in a thick fog.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m not saying I "
"would like to return, but thinking about it does make me feel rather homesick. ⟪k:4⟫Does that "
"happen to you?⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nasci em uma ilha perpetuamente coberta por um nevoeiro espesso. ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Não estou "
"dizendo que gostaria de voltar, mas pensar nisso me faz sentir um pouco de saudades de casa. ⟪k:4⟫"
"Isso acontece com você?⟪k:5⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D927D0C4_01DE_4490_ADDF_462274F505D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eab3a86f324fb18357ff1cb4609fdb98c6d24a30a409f72008fca5ddbb42bedc
#. default-sha256: 4bd15a6ace86e8ef082742cf567f3e2f7579b559e955f3249492acb0cc46689a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D927D0C4_01DE_4490_ADDF_462274F505D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫That reminds me—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫aside from that one time, you have not told me much of your "
"homeland. ⟪k:4⟫It would be nice if we could pay it a visit together sometime.⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Isto me lembra—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫além daquela vez, você não me falou muito de sua terra natal. "
"⟪k:4⟫Seria bom se pudéssemos fazer uma visita juntos algum dia.⟪k:5⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A418DE7_22D7_4FF4_B384_F3B33B5554EE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 412ca43bd0aee348e221eb87bae3ee100e38315bcd84cd1003fdbac5263b4ca3
