msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I was unable to attend... ⟪k:2⟫but perhaps you had the chance when it was near you?⟪k:3⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu não pude comparecer...⟪k:2⟫mas talvez você teve a chance quando esteve perto de você?"
"⟪k:3⟫"

