msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had he simply stepped up and taken action,⟪k:1⟫he could have put an end to the stream of "
"letters,⟪k:2⟫each of which gave rise to further misunderstanding."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se ele simplesmente tivesse levantado e agido,⟪k:1⟫ele poderia ter posto fim ao fluxo de "
"cartas,⟪k:2⟫cada uma das quais dava origem a mais mal-entendidos."

#: scenario3:scenario3_71E4F38E_1917_4891_8C16_CC927E4DD979
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b9664cd81312227a24039cec87dd7ea0f8ee3517a5511772e48b95777f66e6d
