"⟪k:0⟫I feel as though I have now, at long last,⟪k:1⟫come to understand just what kind of man "
"Jacopo was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sinto que agora, finalmente,⟪k:1⟫vim a entender exatamente que tipo de homem Jacopo era."

#: scenario3:scenario3_92DD5E58_656C_41CC_B352_6418C5733715
