"⟪k:0⟫While he had a great deal of pride in his capabilities,⟪k:1⟫he had far less confidence in "
"himself as a person."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora tivesse muito orgulho de suas capacidades,⟪k:1⟫ele tinha muito menos confiança em si "
"mesmo como pessoa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8B5731DA_FAA4_4F9A_9D09_516331D630E1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
