msgid "⟪k:0⟫If he’d had faith in himself, perhaps he could have put faith in his wife as well."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se ele tivesse fé em si mesmo, talvez pudesse ter confiado em sua esposa também."

#: scenario3:scenario3_996E988B_CC27_45E8_9A67_223B48B8DA7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
