"⟪k:0⟫Had his pride not been so twisted, perhaps he would not have been so afraid of being hurt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se seu orgulho não fosse tão distorcido, talvez ele não tivesse tanto medo de ser ferido."

