"⟪k:0⟫Indeed, he was afraid. ⟪k:1⟫Afraid of being rejected by her. ⟪k:2⟫Afraid to face a reality "
"where his beloved partner scorned him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De fato, ele estava com medo. ⟪k:1⟫Medo de ser rejeitado por ela. ⟪k:2⟫Medo de enfrentar uma "
"realidade em que sua amada parceira o desprezava."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9D8604A1_08B8_4080_A485_47F651DB92D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
