"⟪k:0⟫Where the woman he loved laughed at him disdainfully. ⟪k:1⟫Where she and countless others "
"mocked him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Onde a mulher que ele amava ria dele com desdém. ⟪k:1⟫Onde ela e inúmeros outros zombavam "
"dele."

